Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.87,0:01:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Snow is the sign of a good harvest !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:55.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take it, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:01:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother, come by my house !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:01:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.67,0:02:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:09.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you know we were coming ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:11.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you busy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I've seen him act like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,He must need help for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.87,0:02:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have anything to ask, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:44.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's only borrowing some silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:54.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's so embarrassing about it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,wait until we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:02:59.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,since Father won't speak, then I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother wants to buy the shop next to ours
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make our shop bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but we don't have enough money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to borrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,my wife thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,that our shop is too small
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,and that it limits our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:20.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,She saw that old Li's shop is for rent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:22.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,so she wanted it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much do you need ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The shop is pretty big
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:28.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we have to pay 2 years of rent at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:29.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,50 taels of silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,30
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 taels is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:39.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother clearly said 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:55.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't need this much !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only want to borrow 30 taels of silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:03:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:01.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not lending you this money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Da Niu's New Year's money
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:06.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it's also money for wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd like to buy a jug of wine every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.13,0:04:07.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This money is worth 10 years of fruit wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:16.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Uncle Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've recieved so much at New Year !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:26.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get up, Brother Ceng.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's 10 years or 8 years ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on, as long as you live here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll send you a jug of this wine every day !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll deliver it to Uncle Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:51.86,Second,,0,0,0,,Goodbye Uncle Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:50.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's cold ouside,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:51.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's go back quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 400 years of killing intent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:04.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,have been condensed into 4 beads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to understand the heavens,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to completely embrace
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the life of a mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,for a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:19.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)\pos(964,521)}6 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Teng Huayuan was still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,he would never recognize
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,that this mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the all-powerful Wang Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,are the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:45.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,that he had parents and a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But for the past 6 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's been all alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't come over by youself,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.39,0:06:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I must invite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:03.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Uncle Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is your favorite beef sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eat more during the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This beef is good for the stomach
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you have to eat it with wine !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cheers !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.27,0:06:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the money you lent us before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to return some of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,I told you before, it's for buying wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:38.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,No need to return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.99,0:06:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're an honest person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.75,0:06:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:44.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be where we are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:47.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will always take you in as our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to pay you back little by little,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:50.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is to show our goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:51.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,My family
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,will never take advantage of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.02,Second,,0,0,0,,That's right, Brother Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it's not as good as yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,our business is also doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The market opened early this year !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Boss, business is flourishing !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:25.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:26.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have silver for tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how friendly you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:34.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,The manager has ordered that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,the first seat by the east window
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is always reserved for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,this wine comes from overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:43.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Manager Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to collect rent
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Business is not good lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I spent a lot of money hiring this troupe to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the 20 taels of gold you lent us last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:02.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,our theater would have been closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This little lady sure sings well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,She lured me here from the north of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gooood !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this beggar doing here ? Go away !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have money today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare to touch me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:18.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you touch me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:20.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll lie down here and never get up !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here to listen to the music !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the New Year,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give you money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a real one !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's harder than gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's your manager's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A pot of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:39.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang is kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll let you off the hook today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If no one guides you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you will never reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity, how pitiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:03.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:04.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We haven't met in 7 years, you still look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You became a mortal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You really turned into a mortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good wine !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:24.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've seen countless cutivators forming their soul in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:28.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you are the first one to be able to turn mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,in just 6 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:33.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:35.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:37.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,your flesh and blood are similar to a mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,but your soul is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:42.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you can experience a domain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise that you will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:44.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,reach Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,within 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is a domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:50.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:52.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:53.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I get hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you treat me to a meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:00.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, take your time to enjoy the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:17.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:20.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this the place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:22.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,where you're turning mortal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:27.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Flood Dragon !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Flame Spider
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:30.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven Noise Beast
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:33.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhong Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:34.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eight-clawed Beast
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ti Lun !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.73,0:10:43.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,You managed to bring most of the beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:44.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the Sea of Devils here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I really underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:52.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never would have thought that you had such experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have been able to make these carvings
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,of Soul Formation cultivators and Desolate beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:02.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you hadn't fought them personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your name ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:08.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:19.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't see through his cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's probably higher than Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,my old house
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot withstand your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please restrain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:33.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:34.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,experience it for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.91,0:11:36.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.59,0:11:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is my Raging Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used this domain back then
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Under this domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,all spiritual energy and even your Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be assimilated
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and fall under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is the power of a domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:10.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,why have none of the Soul Formation cultivators I met before
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:13.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,displayed this kind of domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,My bad, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lowered my cultivation to Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:20.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,but my domain upgraded at Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it was a little too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Formation cultivators don't display their domains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only a sliver of it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,is present in their spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's hard to detect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Based on your past achievements,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you experience more domains, you will break past Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about I help you reach Soul Formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, why are you helping me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:54.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can tell that these carvings are pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.19,0:12:55.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can give you all of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,What would I want your low quality carvings for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only those half finished carvings are worth looking at
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I have no use for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm handsome, bright and dominating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:14.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did I move your heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.95,0:13:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you think
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would make a very good model for a carving ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:20.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But my cultivation isn't high enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I failed making Soul Formation carvings,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:26.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,not to mention a Senior like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only after I reach Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:31.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,can I make your carving perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must make it perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want a nude carving too, you must make it perfect !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you've got to make more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:43.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want a hundred !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.15,0:13:47.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will give my carvings to all the beautiful ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:52.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up ? For what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:56.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,To have you experience more domains of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A teleportation of 100 000 li ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,can only teleport up to 1000 li.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can a Soul Transformation cross 100 000 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's his cultivation level ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm getting old,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,my body is a lot worse than it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This teleportation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,only moved us 100 000 li.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:36.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,have you seen someone teleport this distance before ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,After seeing how powerful I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:45.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't even let out a fart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior's cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is something Junior has never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admire you !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the White Cloud Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:56.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go, this old man will take you to trash that sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:14:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,are we just going like this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unless someone is two full levels above you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.79,0:15:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,they won't be able to see your appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is something I've saved for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:12.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must return it to me when we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,This hat looks ordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it has countless restrictions on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:22.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,The essence of these restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,is comparable to ancient restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:49.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,What an overbearing technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:51.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Goldy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,smash !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:03.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation of a rank 4 country,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,was broken in a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's it ? Disappearing already ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:22.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,I fed you so many artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:23.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,and put effort in you every day !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:25.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet you're too lazy to play around ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:27.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who destroyed the formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sect is worthy of a rank 4 country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:35.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are more
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:37.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,than 30 Nascent Souls cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And those 5 are Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:50.85,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1332,484)}Wen Baoxin\NWhite Cloud Sect Leader\NSoul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,The two of you broke my White Cloud Sect's formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't explain this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't care,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.57,0:17:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just a hired hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,He asked me to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:04.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:31.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:35.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:41.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:41.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.89,0:17:46.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:50.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:56.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:56.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:01.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.65,0:18:01.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.01,0:18:05.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:09.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:09.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:13.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.73,0:18:21.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:21.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:29.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:29.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:36.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:36.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:46.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:46.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.97,0:19:22.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:22.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:30.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:30.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:39.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:39.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:47.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.65,0:19:47.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
